Title, short and full description of the ALMOVA listing, and phone
screenshots of the physiotherapy, food, conversation, agenda and sharing
screens. test/screenshots/almova_store_screenshots.dart renders them
with the real fonts and sample data, no emulator needed, and is not
part of the suite. The tablet screenshots of the wger app are gone from
this listing.

